    "created_at": "2016-04-24T14:05:56Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-04-24T14:05:56Z",
    "body": "@rniwa @hayatoito @RByers @dominiccooney would really appreciate feedback on this and https://github.com/w3c/webcomponents/issues/485 as they're blocking specifying the event dispatch model that takes shadow trees into account. That in turn is blocking defining how e.g., `<script>` works in shadow trees since its `load` event needs to be scoped. (See https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/1100 for the specifics of that.)\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
