    "created_at": "2016-04-25T08:06:36Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-04-25T08:08:28Z",
    "body": "Could you help me to understand the point? I have tried to understand the comments in this issue and w3c/webcomponents#485. I am wondering:\n1. The point is how we can update the DOM Standard clearly, without changing the semantics defined in the current Shadow DOM spec?\n2. Or, you have found the ambiguous part in the current Shadow DOM spec?\n3. Or, you are proposing the behavior change?\n\nMaybe some of them are being mixed, I guess.\n\nLet me take another look later.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
