    "body": "The question is just about when to call the listeners on shadow host. I think (3) is the way to go, and not (1), even though that complicates Gecko's code a bit, since XBL1 needs (1).\nBut @annevk  wrote different kind of algorithm, which was (2), in https://github.com/w3c/webcomponents/issues/485\n",
