    "body": "See the following issues for the history:\nhttps://www.w3.org/Bugs/Public/show_bug.cgi?id=15543\nhttps://www.w3.org/Bugs/Public/show_bug.cgi?id=21404\n\nhttps://www.w3.org/Bugs/Public/show_bug.cgi?id=21404#c10 is what the spec defines.\nBlink implements this.\n",
